      "say": "Now the names. Singular means one, ганц тоо. Plural means more than one, олон тоо. [click] And the main rule is simple: most nouns just add s. That one rule covers most nouns in English.",
      "teach": "This is where the two grammar terms enter, after the student has already seen the pattern on slide 2.",
